   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div class=\"alert alert-block alert-success\"><b>Step 7 (2 pts)</b>: Begin by elaborating in more detail from the previous assignment on why you chose this data?<br>\n",
    "    \n",
    "1. Explain what you hope to learn from this data. \n",
