  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Data Dictionary — City of Austin eCheckbook\n",
    "\n",
    "Source: Column metadata from [Austin Finance Online](https://datahub.austintexas.gov/d/567b-4d24/visualization)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** The eCheckbook consists of purchases of goods and services made by City departments from third parties. It does not include employee payroll data and internal management accounting transactions.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Description | Data Type | Example |\n",
    "| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n",
    "| FY_DC | Fiscal year of the transaction (Austin FY runs Oct 1 – Sep 30) | Numeric | 2024 |\n",
    "| PER_CD | Accounting period within the fiscal year (1–12) | Text | 8 |\n",
    "| DEPT_CD | Department code | Text | 11 |\n",
    "| DEPT_NM | Department name | Text | Austin Energy |\n",
    "| FUND_CD | Fund code — identifies the funding source | Text | 5010 |\n",
    "| FUND_NM | Fund name | Text | Austin Energy Fund |\n",
    "| DIV_CD | Division code within the department | Text | 2ESD |\n",
    "| DIV_NM | Division name | Text | Electric Service Delivery |\n",
    "| GP_CD | Group code — sub-unit within a division | Text | 2PDL |\n",
    "| GP_NM | Group name | Text | Power Delivery Support |\n",
    "| OCAT_CD | Object category code — high-level expense classification | Text | 152 |\n",
    "| OCAT_NM | Object category name (Contractuals, Commodities, etc.) | Text | Contractuals |\n",
    "| OBJ_CD | Object code — detailed expense line item | Text | 5864 |\n",
    "| OBJ_NM | Object name — specific expense description | Text | Services-Prepared Food and Catering |\n",
    "| LGL_NM | Vendor legal name — payee on the transaction | Text | Delesdernier, Estelle |\n",
    "| VEND_CUST_CD | Vendor/customer ID in the financial system | Text | MIS0000024 |\n",
    "| VEND_CUST_IND | Vendor (V) or Customer (C) indicator | Text | V |\n",
    "| RFED_DOC_CD | Reference document type code (GAX = General Accounting, GAXD = Debt, etc.) | Text | GAX |\n",
    "| RFED_DOC_DEPT_CD | Department code on the reference document | Text | 1100 |\n",
    "| RFED_DOC_ID | Reference document ID — unique transaction document number | Text | 24050106606 |\n",
    "| CHK_EFT_ISS_DT | Check/EFT issue date — when payment was issued | DateTime | 2024-05-16 |\n",
    "| CVL_CHK_STA_DV | Check status (Paid, Outstanding, Cancelled, etc.) | Text | Paid |\n",
    "| RFED_VEND_LN_NO | Vendor line number on the reference document | Text | 1 |\n",
    "| RFED_COMM_LN_NO | Commodity line number on the reference document | Text | 0 |\n",
    "| RFED_ACTG_LN_NO | Accounting line number on the reference document | Text | 2 |\n",
    "| ACTG_LN_DSCR | Accounting line description — free-text description of the expense | Text | Services-Prepared Food and Catering |\n",
    "| AMOUNT | Dollar amount of the transaction | Numeric | 19.00 |\n",
    "| CAL_YEAR | Calendar year of the transaction | Numeric | 2024 |\n",
    "| CAL_MONTH | Calendar month of the transaction | Numeric | 5 |\n",
    "| COMM_CD | A standardized commodity code which specifies the product ordered | Text | 92517 |\n",
    "| COMM_DSCR | Commodity Code description of the product ordered | Text | Traffic and Transportation Engineering |\n",
    "| RF_DOC_CD | Purchase order code that the document references | Text | DOM |\n",
    "| RF_DOC_DEPT_CD | Department Code | Text | 8500 |\n",
    "| RF_DOC_ID | Alpha-numeric purchase order number | Text | MAX104988 |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note on data types:**\n",
    "\n",
    "Some fields above appear numeric but were loaded as string or text values as they are codes or identifiers. They will not be used in any mathematical operations (e.g., averaging department codes is meaningless). In my EDA, `AMOUNT`, `FY_DC`, `CAL_YEAR`, `CAL_MONTH` are the only fields to be treated as numeric."
   ]
