    "#### **SD Response:**\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on the steps I performed above, I will clean the dataset as below: \n",
    "1. I will check the dataset for duplicates before dropping any column to understand if there are data integrity issues. \n",
    "2. I will be dropping the code columns where the name field is either more descriptive or clearer for a reader (e.g., I will drop department code and retain department name)\n",
